pywebdriver (3.0.22-1~deb13u2) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Ship udev rule granting pywebdriver access to USB printers and reload
    udev rules on package configuration.
  * Add Epson TM-T20IV (04b8:0e39) to supported ESC/POS printers.
  * Fix receipt printing with Odoo 13+ which sends receipts as base64 JPEG
    images: render them with the python-escpos image engine instead of the
    bundled xmlescpos <img> path that rejected images taller than 255px and
    crashed on 3-channel JPEGs.

 -- Florent Jardin <florent@jardin.im>  Mon, 17 Aug 2026 16:30:00 +0200

pywebdriver (3.0.22-1~deb13u1) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian 13 (Trixie) packaging release.
  * Update build dependencies and packaging rules for Python 3.11+ compliance.
  * Ensure systemd service integration and local SSL certificate generation via mkcert.

